            "review_title": "Review at Gogi House",
            "review_text": "Daty L\n74 contributions\n0\nVery good food and staff is helpful\nApr 2019 • Family\nMy family and I usually enjoyed the food here, I even took my friend to dine here and also received good comments. Price is at mid-range but still reasonable for the food. Basically, they all set the standard fro all gogi house around HCM (I have tried District 7, District 11, AEON Bing Tan and Le Van Sy).\n\nThe staff will assisted you to grill and served if they have time, but not during peak hour. This is fine to me, because BBQ is self service actually.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 27, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
