            "review_title": "Review at Gogi House",
            "review_text": "Luan N\nLong Grove, Illinois47 contributions\n0\nGood Korean BBQ\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nFor a party of 4, with a Soju bottle, a shared desert, and plenty of BBQ meat, the final bill was about 1.2M which at the rate of 23,200 / us$, is about US$50. That's very reasonable, with good service and nice air-conditioned ambience. The wait staffs replaced the bbq grill many times (4+) during our dinning time there. The foods were good. They did run out of some vegetables (plenty of lettuce) to roll with the bbq.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 13, 2019",
