            "review_text": "Jacob G\nCollege Station, Texas112 contributions\n0\nKorean in a Sea of Viet\nJan 2018 • Couples\nFun, hearty, tasty, and great for a party of 2-6 people! Korean BBQ done at your table on a small grill with coals. We had 3 different meats and a big hot pot soup - all were wonderful. They bring out an assortment of small sides, and meat trimmings, including lettuce to make wraps. I also highly suggest their \"sparkler\" drinks and both of the fruit drinks listed below them (the name eludes me). Enjoy!\nRead more\nWritten January 11, 2018",
