            "review_text": "Lulu\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam92 contributions\n0\nNice food!\nDec 2016 • Family\nI went there to have lunch with my family. The place wasn't so crowded at lunch and the service was extremely helpful. The lunch set was very nice and cheap. We really did enjoy the great food. So far, this place is the closest to the \"authentic Korean food\" title in my opinion.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 20, 2016",
