            "review_text": "HaijoLee\nStavanger, Norway719 contributions\n0\nFirst time eating at Gogi\nDec 2016 • Couples\nAfter some heavy research about various korean bbq in hcmc, we decided to go here. \n\nAt first the restaurant looked empty, but after an hour the restaurant was packed with people. \n\nThe service was excellent. \nThey are busy running around, but they will help you cook the meat properly and cut it. \nThey are also very attentive with refilling all the small side dishes, such as kimchi. \n\nWe ordered several servings of the famous pork belly meat (samgyeopsal) and their tender beef meat. \nI can also recommend the octopus. \n\nSoju tasted authentic just like in korea. \nThe free Side dishes were also great with all the meat. \n\nI'm glad we went here to eat.\nRead more\nWritten December 11, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
