            "review_text": "kim P\n11 contributions\n0\nThe worst Gogi meal I've ever had\nMar 2016 • Friends\nCame there with my friends on the weekend. The food wasn't as good as other places which were very dried. But I dont think it was as bad as the service we have been offered. The waitress didn't help us out as she was very busy, so I made it ourself. It wasn't so much big deal till we 've just finished our meal and they come to ask us to leave as people have made a reservation for this table, oh come on! We asked for bill and I give my membership card for her, then another girl came and ask us to check out. We said we were waiting for the bill, she went and came back with the bill. We paid and I asked for my membership card. The girl said she didnt take it from me. I asked her to check and then she checked and gave me the card back. I asked her \"did you add this bill into my card\". She said yes. Weeks later the email from the Golden Gate Group came and I didn't see this transaction. She lay!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 20, 2016",
