            "review_text": "edge8400\nValrico, Florida567 contributions\n0\nNice Grill Experience\nJul 2016 • Family\nWas a nice treat. Gogi has a varied menu for both carnivores and herbivores. Tables and grills are well designed with a venting system that releases no smoke. Staff was courteous and place was clean.\n\nIt is different in that the staff grills the food for you leaving you free to chat and engage family.\n\nUnfortunately the setup is not designed for wheelchair accessibility.\n\nThe menu also sports normal dishes; soups, stews, bulgogi and bimbimbap.\n\nDefinitely worth a try if you enjoy Korean Grilled food.\nRead more\nWritten July 4, 2016",
