            "review_text": "Lizz M\nHat Yai, Thailand75 contributions\n0\nNot enough vegetables!\nAug 2015 • Friends\nI've been to lots of Korean BBQ places before, the staff at Gogi house were very nice and the food was great but there is not much selection for different dietary needs. There is no selection of vegetables on the menu and really only meat. Such a shame there was no vegetables as overall the restaurant is great. Personally I'm not invested in the idea of Korean Bbq with coals, I prefer the electric version as it is quicker and you smell less after, but as far as authentic taste goes it was pretty good.\nRead more\nWritten August 27, 2015",
